#: qml/SettingsPage.qml:134
msgctxt "@info privacy"
msgid "Your voice leaves the phone only while you hold to talk: it goes through the proxy you set up to OpenAI, where a voice model understands it and answers. Slide onto × before you let go to cancel, and it is never sent."
